{"sha": "41551ecd09897930c6616c6c4dd8a3cd6730991677f73c1a203e16468f1a9669", "body": ["\\textbf{5.} $E_z = I/\\gamma\\pi a^2 = \\qty{0.027}{V/m}$; $\\Pi_r = E_zB/\\mu_0 = \\qty{210}{W/m^2}$", "指向内侧；$\\times2\\pi a = \\qty{13}{W/m}$；$R = 1/\\gamma\\pi a^2 = \\qty{53}{\\micro\\ohm/m}$，$RI^2 =", "\\qty{13}{W/m}$.", "", "\\textbf{6.} $\\Pi_r/\\Pi_z = E_z/E_r = 1.5 \\times 10^{-8}$：几乎全部能量", "沿导线传输，仅极少量渗入铜中。", "", "\\textbf{7.} 损失 \\qty{133}{kW}，占 \\qty{10}{MW} 的 $1.3\\%$；在 \\qty{200}{kV} 下为 \\qty{1.3}{kW}，", "$0.013\\%$.", "", "\\textbf{8.} $\\int_a^b(B^2/2\\mu_0)2\\pi r\\,\\dd r = (\\mu_0I^2/4\\pi)\\ln(b/a) = \\qty{27}{mJ/m} =", "\\tfrac12\\Lambda I^2$，其中 $\\Lambda = \\mu_0\\ln(b/a)/2\\pi = \\qty{0.22}{\\micro H/m}$；电场情形：", "$\\tfrac12\\Gamma U^2$，其中 $\\Gamma = 2\\pi\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon_r/\\ln(b/a) = \\qty{117}{pF/m}$：\\qty{23}{mJ/m}。", "", "\\textbf{9.} $E_0 = \\qty{870}{V/m}$, $B_0 = \\qty{2.9}{\\micro T}$, $u = \\qty{3.3}{\\micro J/m^3}$,", "\\qty{3e21}{m^{-2}.s^{-1}}.", "", "\\textbf{10.} 电功率 \\qty{320}{W}；热功率 \\qty{1280}{W}，经 \\qty{3.2}{m^2}", "表面散出：$\\Delta T = 1280/32 = \\qty{40}{K}$。", "", "\\textbf{11.} $P = I/c = \\qty{3.3}{\\micro Pa}$；\\qty{5.3}{\\micro N}，与", "\\qty{180}{N}.", "", "\\textbf{12.} $320 \\times 6 = \\qty{1.9}{kWh/day}$，\\qty{700}{kWh/year}；五块太阳能板，面积", "\\qty{8}{m^2}.", "", "\\textbf{13.} $30 \\times 10.7 = \\qty{320}{W}$；功率在两导线之间的场中流动，", "即 $\\vect E$ 跨接 \\qty{30}{V} 电压，$\\vect B$ 绕着电流——", "而不在铜中。", "", "\\textbf{14.} $4\\pi D^2I = \\qty{3.9e26}{W}$; $P/c^2 = \\qty{4.3e9}{kg/s}$.", "", "\\textbf{15.} $5 \\times 10^{21} \\times 1.6 = \\qty{5e21}{}$ 每秒光子数。", "", "\\textbf{16.} $I\\pi R_E^2/c = \\qty{5.8e8}{N}$：相当于重力的 $10^{-14}$。", "", "\\textbf{17.} $\\lambda = \\qty{12.2}{cm}$；\\qty{30}{cm} 的谐振腔约为几个波长", "——是具有若干模式的谐振腔，而非自由光束；金属壁反射", "电磁波（趋肤深度为微米量级），将其约束在腔内。", "", "\\textbf{18.} $0.25 \\times 4180 \\times 60 = \\qty{63}{kJ}$，功率为 \\qty{640}{W} 时需 \\qty{98}{s}；", "$640/2.5 \\times 10^{-4} = \\qty{2.6}{MW/m^3}$.", "", "\\textbf{19.} $I = 640/5 \\times 10^{-3} = \\qty{1.3e5}{W/m^2}$，$E_0 = \\qty{10}{kV/m}$；热点", "相距 $\\lambda/2 = \\qty{6}{cm}$——因此需要转盘。", "", "\\textbf{20.} $W = QP/\\omega = 10^3 \\times 800/1.54 \\times 10^{10} = \\qty{52}{\\micro J}$; $u =", "\\qty{1.7}{mJ/m^3}$；$E_0 = \\sqrt{2u/\\varepsilon_0} = \\qty{20}{kV/m}$——比击穿场强", "低一百倍。", "", "\\textbf{21.} $\\tfrac12\\omega\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon''E_0^2 = \\qty{2.6e6}{W/m^3}$: $E_0 = \\qty{2}{kV/m}$", "水中——与腔场同量级，因水的介电常数而减弱，", "结果相符。", "", "\\textbf{22.} $hf = \\qty{1.6e-24}{J} = \\qty{1e-5}{eV}$；每秒 $4 \\times 10^{26}$ 个光子；", "每个光子的能量比电离所需的少约一百万倍。", "", "\\textbf{23.} $\\sim u = \\qty{2}{mPa}$：否。", "", "\\textbf{24.} 若无物质吸收它，$\\vect\\Pi$ 的通量", "别无去处，只能流回磁控管，致使其过热。", "", "\\textbf{25.} 传输线：电介质中，$\\vect\\Pi$ 沿轴向，\\qty{10}{MW}，末端接", "负载。太阳能板：光束中，$\\vect\\Pi$ 沿太阳光线，\\qty{1.6}{kW}", "输入，\\qty{320}{W} 输出，半导体。烤箱：腔场中，$\\vect\\Pi$", "环绕流动，\\qty{800}{W}，水的偶极子。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}